{'symbol': 'STZ', 'date': '2022-04-07 08:50:00', 'title': 'CONSTELLATION BRANDS ANNOUNCES ACCELERATED STOCK BUYBACK', 'text': "VICTOR, N.Y., APRIL 07, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CONSTELLATION BRANDS, INC. (NYSE: STZ AND STZ.B), A LEADING BEVERAGE ALCOHOL COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN ACCELERATED SHARE REPURCHASE (“ASR”) AGREEMENT WITH BANK OF AMERICA, N.A. TO REPURCHASE $500.0 MILLION OF ITS CLASS\xa0A COMMON STOCK (“COMMON STOCK”). UNDER THE ASR AGREEMENT, CONSTELLATION WILL RECEIVE APPROXIMATELY 1.7 MILLION SHARES ON APRIL\xa08, 2022, REPRESENTING APPROXIMATELY 80% OF THE EXPECTED SHARE REPURCHASES UNDER THE ASR AGREEMENT, BASED ON THE COMPANY'S APRIL\xa06, 2022 CLOSING STOCK PRICE OF $231.81. THE REPURCHASED SHARES WILL BECOME TREASURY SHARES."}